;DROPS WERE FORMED BY MIXING EQUAL AMOUNTS OF 18-24 MG/ML PROTEIN IN
100 MM HEPES PH 7.0, 400 MM NACL, 30% GLYCEROL, 1 MM EDTA AND 10 MM
N,N- DIMETHYLUNDECYLAMIN-N-OXIDE (C11DAO) WITH A PRECIPITANT SOLUTION
OF 0.1 M ACETATE PH 4.8 40 MM C11DAO, 20.8 MM
N,-DIMETHYLDECYLAMINE-N-OXIDE (DDAO), 2 MM DIHYDROOROTATE (DHO) THE
HANGING DROPS WERE INCUBATED AGAINST 0.5 ML RESERVOIR OF 0.1 M ACETATE
PH 4.8, 1.6-2.2 M AMMONIUM SULFATE AND 30% GLYCEROL., VAPOR DIFFUSION, HANGING DROP, temperature 293K
